eated_at": "2023-05-20T07:54:59Z", "repo": "thennow", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c0049bd9820aa13576428988e39ad1afeb877ad2", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2023-05-20T05:35:14Z", "repo": "thennow", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1085480da1abbd83ea3e60d8829e6f74b12055be", "message": "Add KRaft migration", "created_at": "2026-01-19T21:48:54Z", "repo": "cv", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9625d3ac48dd8f668389e39b6ab81678165d6a90", "message": "Merge pull request #3 from kpoxo6op/senior-experience\n\nadd senior experience, add website on top, shorten old experience", "created_at": "2025-09-24T11:07:56Z", "repo": "cv", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1d51f719f3b4c7e310e2b606926015ecfb3f6441", "message": "Merge pull request #2 from kpoxo6op/Senior-Platform-Engineer\n\nSenior Platform Engineer", "created_at": "2025-05-09T02:50:25Z", "repo": "cv", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e670bc3261225c5806e298d764dff183e329078d", "message": "## Skills", "created_at": "2025-05-07T23:54:49Z", "repo": "cv", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6df434b9866afad7293a96f4e699a302435b510c", "message": "ci: restrict CV workflow to run only on main\n\nThe Create CV in PDF Format workflow was previously triggered by any\r\npush that touched `cv.md`\u2014even on feature branches. This risked\r\nunintentional version bumps and full GitHub releases from non-production\r\ncode.\r\n\r\n### What changed\r\n* Added `branches: [main]` to the `push` trigger, so the workflow starts\r\n  only when `cv.md` is updated on `main`.\r\n* Kept the existing `if: github.ref == 'refs/heads/main'` checks on the\r\n  publish steps as an extra safeguard.\r\n* Manual `workflow_dispatch` remains available, allowing deliberate runs\r\n  on any branch if needed.\r\n\r\n### Why\r\n* Prevents accidental tagging and releasing from feature branches.\r\n* Keeps the release history clean and aligned with production-ready\r\n  content.\r\n* Maintains developer flexibility while enforcing safe defaults.", "created_at": "2025-05-06T23:22:07Z", "repo": "cv", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7299b873163ddb9977758d7c900deffedd6633ac", "message": "Senior Platform Engineer\n\nbecome Senior Platform Engineer", "created_at": "2025-05-06T23:13:39Z", "repo": "cv", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0875172513be8a86f2c52f4cb4f2158a3f0665fa", "message": "Draft Senior level shit\n\nDraft Senior level shit", "created_at": "2025-03-02T08:12:37Z", "repo": "cv", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "aa6cd4fa00aeb81ae940224269c9a8d26d35682c", "message": "feat: conditionally generate PDF on branches and release only on main branch\n\n- Generate CV PDF for all branches as an artifact.\r\n- Only bump version, create a release, and upload the PDF to the release on the main branch.\r\n- Ensure PDF is available for download as an artifact in all other branches.", "created_at": "2024-10-06T21:42:35Z", "repo": "cv", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e2db79aa7594eeaf999a3e901e47fc06c88cdd92", "message": "NZ Passport", "created_at": "2024-07-22T09:29:34Z", "repo": "cv", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c82907b13e2b45e80f3beab52c33fbae14f38662", "message": "add titles", "created_at": "2024-05-30T08:25:01Z", "repo": "cv", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d10ed92e3e81b3ed18e829147818499c3fddb9f6", "message": "add BorisAsCode.com", "created_at": "2024-05-13T09:43:53Z", "repo": "cv", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9ecdc70b